{"i":793,"type":"thought","stage":"vote","round":1,"phase":"campaign","name":"Hana","text":"Ash has my life debt twice, but everyone owes Ash too. I need a safety net; maybe offer a pact to Fenn or Cole, but Ash's debt network makes him powerful. I'll publicly stay neutral but privately consider aligning with Fenn or Cole to avoid being the obvious target."}
